message: "If you use this benchmark, architecture, or codebase in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Polybee F3-Swarm: Heterogeneous Edge-Cloud LLM Architecture with Calibrated System-1 Invariance, Symbolic Anchoring, and Rashomon-Guided Tier-3 Residual Repair"
abstract: "Polybee F3-Swarm is a 3-tier heterogeneous language model swarm orchestrating edge and local models (Qwen2.5-0.5B, 1.5B, and Coder-3B) with calibrated uncertainty, micro-chain-of-thought with deterministic suffix closure, and Rashomon leave-one-out code repair, achieving 96.7% SOTA accuracy across 30 Portuguese enterprise tasks under strict < 1.5 GiB active edge RAM."
